universal_threshold_problem:
Universal threshold: RNA integrity number (RIN) > 7. FFPE total RNA-seq
with ribo-depletion from archival samples routinely uses RIN 2-4 material;
MultiQC flags these as degraded without considering FFPE protocol tolerance.

Universal threshold: batch correction removes > 95% of PC1 variance. Zeitgeber
time-series RNA-seq data is intentionally batch-structured by collection time;
aggressive batch correction removes the biological signal of interest.
